WEBVTT

00:08:29.929 --> 00:08:31.573
beasts of burden,

00:08:31.597 --> 00:08:35.542
almost as inert and dumb
as other farm implements

00:08:35.566 --> 00:08:38.422
they classified them with
in their ledgers.

00:08:39.052 --> 00:08:40.361
And that's what they did.

00:08:41.099 --> 00:08:43.539
The enslaved Africans, on the other hand,

00:08:43.563 --> 00:08:46.635
knew their were embodiments of knowledge.

00:08:46.659 --> 00:08:49.199
They were smiths, they were poets,

00:08:49.223 --> 00:08:52.546
they were political counselors,
they were princes and princesses,

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:55.261
they were mythologists,
they were herbologists,

00:08:57.689 --> 00:08:59.182
they were chefs.

00:08:59.206 --> 00:09:00.659
The list is endless.